  "body": "Privately positioned at the end of Hauraki Road, within a secluded enclave of homes, this beautifully renovated residence offers an enviable blend of style, space and relaxed coastal living.\r\n\r\nJust moments from the sand and shoreline of Takapuna Beach, the setting is wonderfully suited to a lifestyle where mornings begin with a walk along the beach and afternoons are spent relaxing in the privacy of your own oasis.\r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 205sqm across two levels, the home is generous in both scale and design, with three substantial bedrooms, two bathrooms and a separate powder room. The heart of the home is its beautifully appointed open-plan living area, centred around a sleekly styled kitchen complete with scullery, creating a sophisticated yet highly functional space.\r\n\r\nThe connection to the outdoors is exceptional. A sophisticated entertaining area extends the living space beyond the walls, complete with LouvreTec roofing, an outdoor fireplace and built-in stainless-steel BBQ; an inviting setting for long summer lunches, evening drinks or relaxed gatherings with friends.\r\n\r\nBeyond the entertaining area is a truly special secret garden, established with mature trees, lush planting and productive vegetable gardens. Private, peaceful and wonderfully green, it provides a magical space for children to play while offering adults a tranquil retreat from the pace of everyday life.\r\n\r\nConstructed in a combination of Shadowclad and rendered brick, the home was comprehensively renovated approximately eight years ago and has been thoughtfully maintained, providing a stylish and enduring residence with genuine character.\r\n\r\nThe location completes the picture. Takapuna Beach, Hauraki Village and an outstanding selection of schools, including Takapuna Grammar School, are all close at hand, while the cafes, restaurants, boutique shopping and vibrant coastal atmosphere of Takapuna are easily accessible. Off-street parking for visitors and a large purpose-built double garage completes the package.\r\n\r\nThis is beachside living with a difference. Private and peaceful, beautifully appointed and surrounded by established greenery, yet close enough to enjoy everything Takapuna has to offer.",
